# Xreader
===
 Xreader is a document viewer capable of displaying multiple and single page document formats.
 
 It can display and print PostScript (PS), Encapsulated PostScript (EPS), DJVU, DVI, XPS and Portable Document Format (PDF) files.
 
 **Key Features**
 - Bookmarks.
 - Thumbnails.
 - Full screen mode.
 - Presentation mode.
 - Preview mode.
 
